OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after man suffers serious
OL,4,Ahead injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof grievous bodily harm with intent
OL,8,Fafter a man was attacked and left with
OL,9,Fserious head injuries.
OL,11,FKent Police said officers were called
OL,12,Fto a hotel in Earls Avenue, Folkestone,
OL,13,Fat 01:12 GMT on Saturday and a
OL,14,F31-year-old man was taken to hospital.
OL,16,FThe force said: "As part of inquiries,
OL,17,Ftwo men, aged 22 and 37, have been
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of grievous
OL,19,Fbodily harm with intent."
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
